.env
node_modules/
# out/* rather than out/ — git cannot re-include anything inside an excluded DIRECTORY,
# so the negation below only works if the directory itself is never excluded.
out/*
# …except the posts. They are generated INTO out/, but they are authored words — the most
# expensive thing here to reproduce — and losing them to a stray `rm -rf out` or an
# untracked working copy is not a risk worth taking for tidiness.
!out/posts/
assets/generated/
.DS_Store
.idea/
